[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584171\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584372\">1084B10</a></p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the car on the ramp.</p><p>Make sure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position; then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1H</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Drain the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2584133\">0010T84</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584378\">1092C10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584442\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584320\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584583\">2110A60</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584171\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584385\">1020B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584289\">1084B26</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the oil pump cover (1b).</p><p>2. Remove the drive gear.</p><p>3. Remove the driven gear.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065841.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p><a href=\"#/2584372\">1084B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584171\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584119\">0010T10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the driven gear in its housing.</p><p>Place the drive gear in its housing.</p><p>Place the oil pump cover back in its housing\nand tighten the bolts.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Manually rotate the gears to check\nthat they turn without sticking.</p></aside><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584289\">1084B26</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584385\">1020B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584171\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584583\">2110A60</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584320\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584442\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584378\">1092C10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1H</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Refill the engine oil lubrication system \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2584120\">0010T11</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2584122\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Fill the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2584133\">0010T84</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]